[h1]GK2 Vanilla+ – Ultrawide, Performance & Quality of Life[/h1]
[b]The game you know – just smoother, sharper and less fiddly.[/b] Vanilla+ fixes the small annoyances of Graveyard Keeper 2 without changing how it plays: pin what you need to craft, trade the right amounts, get more FPS, play on ultrawide or Steam Deck, and never lose a save again.

[b]Deutsch?[/b] Komplette deutsche Beschreibung und Anleitung im [b]Diskussionen[/b]-Tab oben.

[h2]Why Vanilla+?[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Stays vanilla[/b] – no balance changes, no game files touched, saves stay compatible, remove it anytime.
[*][b]You decide[/b] – every feature has its own switch. "All off (vanilla)" turns everything off, then enable just the 1–2 things you want.
[*][b]Plays nice with other mods[/b] – if a mod that does the same job is installed, Vanilla+ steps aside for that part.
[*][b]Actively maintained[/b] – most features came from your comments. Ideas welcome in the Discussions tab.
[/list]

[h2]Comfort – less running, less guessing[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Pinning[/b] – pin recipes, blueprints, town buildings, blockages and quests. A small list shows have/need for every ingredient, the full ingredient tree, fuel and recipe variants. Craft 2–10× and all amounts scale. Count your inventory only, the area or all chests.
[*][b]Trade the right amount[/b] – at town vendors the slider starts at exactly the amount that still gives a thumbs up. "Add liked goods" puts all of them in at once. You still confirm yourself.
[*][b]Rename zombies[/b] – your own name or roll a new one, any time.
[*][b]Week plan[/b] (F6) – all 7 days at a glance with your own notes and a daily reminder. The game's day wheel only shows today. Spoiler-free.
[*][b]Day & time[/b] in the area box, [b]Esc / B leaves conversations[/b], [b]faster doors & map travel[/b], [b]instant removal[/b] without walking there.
[/list]

[h2]Performance – more FPS on any PC[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Hidden graphics settings[/b] – shadows, ambient occlusion, lights, water, clouds, render mode, physics rate.
[*][b]One-click profiles[/b] – Steam Deck / Battery, Performance, Quality. FPS cap and VSync.
[*][b]Benchmark[/b] – tests all graphics tiers and recommends one. Your settings stay untouched.
[*][b]Steam Deck & Linux[/b] – no tearing with an FPS limit, pause in background saves battery.
[*][b]FPS display[/b] – FPS, 1% low, CPU, GPU, RAM, VRAM, GPU temp, clock – your order, your separator.
[/list]

[h2]Screen[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Ultrawide 21:9 & 32:9[/b] – 2560×1080, 3440×1440, 3840×1080, 5120×1440 and more. Main menu, HUD and full-width rain/snow.
[*][b]OLED black[/b], hide HUD, HUD to center, skip intro logos.
[*][b]Camera[/b] – zoom presets, zoom indoors, mouse wheel. [b]Hi-res screenshots[/b] up to 4×.
[/list]

[h2]Controller – everything works with a gamepad[/h2]
The whole mod menu (LB/RB switch tabs), hold [b]RT[/b] to control the pinned list, [b]LT[/b] adds liked goods at vendors, [b]Y[/b] rolls a zombie name. No mouse or keyboard needed – made for Steam Deck.

[h2]Saves[/h2]
Save overview in the main menu, [b]automatic backups[/b] with one-click restore, extra autosave.

[h2]Optional – not fully vanilla (off by default)[/h2]
Often requested, so they're in – but switched off until you want them:
[list]
[*][b]Move objects[/b] – workbenches, chests, conveyors and everything else. Same object, contents and crafting queue are kept.
[*][b]Full refund[/b] when removing buildings.
[/list]

[h2]New in 1.6[/h2]
Rename zombies, trade the thumbs-up amount, Pins 2.0 (2–10×), day & time on the HUD, Esc/B leaves conversations, menu tabs + "All off", Steam Deck tearing fix, Portuguese, full controller support.
[b]1.6.1–1.6.2:[/b] fix for a startup crash with GK2 Mod Framework, the menu button is now called "Vanilla+", the controller button for pins can be freely assigned (and no longer interferes in game windows).
[i]Over 1,200 subscribers – thank you! Many of your ideas are in this update.[/i]

[h2]Install (Windows)[/h2]
[olist]
[*]Click [b]Subscribe[/b] and wait until Steam has downloaded it.
[*]Open [i]<Steam library>\steamapps\workshop\content\4358690\3808053878[/i]
[*]Double-click [b]Installieren.bat[/b] (SmartScreen: "More info" → "Run anyway") → [b]Install[/b].
[*]Start the game, press [b]F9[/b] or click [b]Vanilla+[/b].
[/olist]
Includes BepInEx 5.4.23.5. [b]Updates:[/b] mod menu → [b]Save & update[/b]. [b]Uninstall:[/b] Installieren.bat → [b]Uninstall[/b].
[b]Mac (CrossOver) / Linux / Steam Deck:[/b] step-by-step guide pinned in the Discussions tab.

[h2]FAQ[/h2]
[b]Does it change the game?[/b] No. Only the optional extras above do, and they're off by default.
[b]Can I remove it?[/b] Yes, anytime – Installieren.bat → Uninstall. Your saves keep working.
[b]Too much for me?[/b] Use "All off (vanilla)" and switch on only what you want.
[b]Bug or idea?[/b] Discussions tab – please attach [i]BepInEx\LogOutput.log[/i] for bugs.
[b]Languages:[/b] English, German, French, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Chinese.

[h2]Credits & license[/h2]
You may include Vanilla+ [b]unmodified[/b] in free mod packs with credit ("GK2 Vanilla+ by McFly7"). Modifying or re-uploading it as your own is not allowed.
Source: [url=https://github.com/Matshio7/gk2-vanilla-plus]github.com/Matshio7/gk2-vanilla-plus[/url]
Some features inspired by "Recipe Pin" (farfars), "Daily Reminder" (MrsKiraSayers), "GK2 Ultrawide Rain Fix" (Dry Bones), "What time is it", "ESC to Leave" (OrionAF) and "Instant Transitions" (LeBetoven) – own implementation.
